#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:2
msgid "Classical Solvers"
msgstr "Solucionadores Clásicos"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:4
msgid ""
":mod:`qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers` wraps a handful of purely classical "
"optimizers. They exist so that an optimization problem written as a "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model` can be solved without a backend, giving "
"you a reference solution to compare a quantum result against."
msgstr ""
":mod:`qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers` envuelve un puñado de optimizadores "
"puramente clásicos. Existen para que un problema de optimización escrito "
"como un :class:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model` pueda resolverse sin un backend, "
"lo que te da una solución de referencia con la que comparar un resultado "
"cuántico."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:8
msgid ""
"Every solver subclasses "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolver` and "
"exposes a single "
":meth:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolver.solve` "
"method that takes a model and returns a "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolverResult`."
msgstr ""
"Todos los solucionadores heredan de "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolver` y "
"exponen un único método "
":meth:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolver.solve` "
"que toma un modelo y devuelve un "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolverResult`."

